{
  "title": "EventBridge · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "발생한 이벤트의 내용에 따라 필요한 서비스로 전달합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>EventBridge</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#guide-1\">이벤트 내용으로 전달 대상 선택</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#guide-2\">연결과 일정 기능 구분</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>통합</span><span>25 / 62</span></div><h1>EventBridge</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>EventBridge는 <strong>애플리케이션이나 AWS 서비스에서 발생한 이벤트를 규칙에 맞는 처리 대상으로 연결하는 서비스</strong>입니다. 이벤트를 만드는 서비스가 처리할 모든 서비스를 직접 알 필요 없이 동작하게 합니다.</p><p>예를 들어 주문 상태 변경, 파일 처리 완료, 리소스 변경 같은 사건의 내용을 보고 Lambda, SQS, Step Functions 등으로 전달할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"custom-event-bus\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"custom-event-bus-classic\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"event-patterns-and-targets\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"retries-dlqs-and-permissions\"></span><h2>이벤트 내용으로 전달 대상 선택</h2><p>이벤트 버스에 이벤트가 들어오면 규칙의 이벤트 패턴<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>과 비교합니다. 일치한 이벤트는 해당 규칙에 설정된 하나 이상의 대상으로 전달됩니다.</p><p>각 대상이 필요한 형식으로 입력을 바꾸고, 대상 호출 권한과 실패 시 재시도·DLQ를 구성합니다. 필요한 이벤트는 보관한 뒤 다시 재생하는 방식도 사용할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"archive-and-replay\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"eventbridge-pipes\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"eventbridge-scheduler\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"api-destinations-and-schema-registry\"></span><h2>연결과 일정 기능 구분</h2><p><strong>Pipes</strong>는 지원되는 소스와 대상 사이의 필터링·변환·보강을 구성하는 연결 방식입니다. <strong>Scheduler</strong>는 특정 시간이나 반복 일정에 작업을 실행할 때 사용합니다.</p><p>이벤트 전달과 작업의 성공 여부는 구분해 관찰합니다. 전체 업무 순서와 분기, 재시도를 관리해야 하면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/\">Step Functions</a>를 함께 사용합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>규칙으로 이벤트 연결</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>이벤트 발생</strong><span>AWS·사용자 애플리케이션</span></li><li><strong>패턴 비교</strong><span>관심 있는 이벤트 선택</span></li><li><strong>대상 호출</strong><span>함수·큐·워크플로</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">이벤트 생산자와 처리자를 규칙으로 연결해 시스템 사이의 직접 의존을 줄입니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>주문 상태가 결제 완료로 바뀐 이벤트만 선택해 배송 워크플로를 시작합니다. 재고 변경 이벤트는 다른 규칙으로 재고 처리 큐에 보냅니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>이벤트 패턴</strong> — 이벤트의 출처나 세부 필드 값 등이 어떤 조건을 만족해야 하는지 정의한 필터입니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/eventbridge/latest/userguide/eb-what-is.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What Is Amazon EventBridge? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q074/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q074\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q074\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q074</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q074/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to filter EC2 instance state-change events and send matching events to Lambda using a Classic event bus and rules. Which service provides this capability?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q074\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q074\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q074\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront caching</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q074\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EventBridge</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/\">EventBridge</a> 규칙이 이벤트 패턴을 걸러 대상에 전달한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/\">EventBridge</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q076\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q076\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q076</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q076/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A workflow must explicitly handle branching, retries, and compensation across payment, inventory reservation, and shipment creation. Which service should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q076\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Step Functions</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q076\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q076\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS gp3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q076\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/\">Step Functions</a>는 다단계 워크플로의 상태·분기·재시도를 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/\">Step Functions</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q073\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q073\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q073</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q073/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">The same event must reach separate SQS queues for an email service and an analytics service. Which pattern is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS Multi-Attach volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Subscribe both SQS queues to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Duplicate one ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Connect two workers to a single SQS queue only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a>→여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐가 각 소비자 그룹에 사본을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,1\" data-question=\"Q092\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q092\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q092</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q092/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order event must be processed independently by several services. Which TWO components are central to the design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A separate SQS queue for each consumer service</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Publish the event to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">All workers share the same ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Move one EBS volume between AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Remove every network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>과 소비자별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐를 조합한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q077\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q077\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q077</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q077/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A mobile application calls Lambda functions through an HTTPS API and needs authentication and request throttling. Which front-end service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q077\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q077\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q077\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon API Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q077\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a>는 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 인증·제한 등을 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">이전 용어 <b>ENI</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">다음 용어 <b>FSx</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
